title: "KudioEnhance"
abstract: "Train and run learned speech-enhancement (denoising) models on top of the kudio audio toolkit: five models on the log-power spectrogram and GTCRN on the complex spectrum, with GTCRN weights trained on VoiceBank-DEMAND on the CPU."
